---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const jsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'LocalBusiness',
  name: 'Savor & Stories',
  telephone: '+33626391783',
  email: 'contact@savornstories.com',
  url: 'https://savorstories.com',
  areaServed: ['Bordeaux', 'Dieppe'],
};
---
<Layout
  title="Savor & Stories | Private Tours in Bordeaux & Dieppe with Antoine"
  description="Authentic French experiences, told by locals. Private wine, food and history tours in Bordeaux and Dieppe with Antoine."
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <div
    class="relative bg-cover bg-center px-5 pt-10 pb-8 md:pt-20 md:pb-16 text-center"
    style="background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom right, rgba(61,92,58,.88), rgba(44,74,94,.88)), url('/assets/photos/bordeaux-miroir-deau.jpg')"
  >
    <img
      src="/assets/savorstories-logo.png"
      alt="Savor & Stories, Bordeaux, France"
      class="w-32 md:w-44 mx-auto mb-5 md:mb-7 drop-shadow-lg"
    />
    <h1 class="text-cream text-[28px] md:text-5xl font-bold leading-snug md:leading-tight max-w-[480px] md:max-w-2xl mx-auto">
      <span data-lang="en">Authentic French experiences, told by locals</span>
      <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Des expériences françaises authentiques, racontées par des locaux</span>
      <span data-lang="es" hidden>Experiencias francesas auténticas, contadas por locales</span>
    </h1>
    <div class="w-10 h-0.5 bg-gold mx-auto my-4 md:my-6"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-[480px] md:max-w-3xl lg:max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="px-4 md:px-6 pt-6 md:pt-10 pb-2 text-sm md:text-base leading-relaxed text-ink-soft space-y-4 md:max-w-2xl md:mx-auto">
      <div data-lang="en">
        <p>I'm Antoine, and these are the two French towns I actually know inside out. Bordeaux gave the world its wine trade and two thousand years of history to go with it. Dieppe gave me something quieter: a working scallop port, chalk cliffs, and a castle above the beach. Pick a city below and I'll show you around myself.</p>
        <p class="mt-4">I keep every group small on purpose. Ask me anything along the way and I'll actually answer it.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="fr" hidden>
        <p>Je m'appelle Antoine, et voici les deux villes françaises que je connais vraiment par cœur. Bordeaux a donné au monde son commerce du vin et deux mille ans d'histoire avec. Dieppe m'a donné quelque chose de plus tranquille&nbsp;: un port de pêche à la coquille Saint-Jacques en activité, des falaises de craie, et un château au dessus de la plage. Choisissez une ville ci dessous et je vous ferai visiter moi même.</p>
        <p class="mt-4">Je garde volontairement chaque groupe petit. Posez moi n'importe quelle question en chemin, j'y répondrai vraiment.</p>
      </div>
      <div data-lang="es" hidden>
        <p>Soy Antoine, y estas son las dos ciudades francesas que realmente conozco a fondo. Burdeos le dio al mundo su comercio del vino y dos mil años de historia junto con él. Dieppe me dio algo más tranquilo: un puerto pesquero de vieiras en activo, acantilados de creta, y un castillo sobre la playa. Elige una ciudad abajo y te la mostraré yo mismo.</p>
        <p class="mt-4">Mantengo cada grupo pequeño a propósito. Pregúntame lo que quieras por el camino, te responderé de verdad.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="px-4 md:px-6 pt-6 md:pt-10 pb-2">
      <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.15em] text-label uppercase font-bold text-center mb-4 md:mb-6">
        <span data-lang="en">Choose your city</span>
        <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Choisissez votre ville</span>
        <span data-lang="es" hidden>Elige tu ciudad</span>
      </p>

      <div class="md:grid md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-5">
        <a href="/bordeaux" class="block bg-white rounded-2xl border border-border mb-4 md:mb-0 p-5 md:p-7 no-underline text-inherit">
          <div class="text-[9px] tracking-[0.2em] text-label uppercase font-bold mb-1">
            <span data-lang="en">South West France</span>
            <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Sud-Ouest de la France</span>
            <span data-lang="es" hidden>Suroeste de Francia</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-wine">Bordeaux</h2>
          <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-ink-soft leading-relaxed mt-2">
            <span data-lang="en">Wine, food, history and a bike ride along the Garonne.</span>
            <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Vin, gastronomie, histoire et une balade à vélo le long de la Garonne.</span>
            <span data-lang="es" hidden>Vino, gastronomía, historia y un paseo en bicicleta junto al Garona.</span>
          </p>
        </a>

        <a href="/dieppe" class="block bg-white rounded-2xl border border-border mb-4 md:mb-0 p-5 md:p-7 no-underline text-inherit">
          <div class="text-[9px] tracking-[0.2em] text-label uppercase font-bold mb-1">
            <span data-lang="en">Normandy</span>
            <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Normandie</span>
            <span data-lang="es" hidden>Normandía</span>
          </div>
          <h2 class="text-xl md:text-2xl font-bold text-teal">Dieppe</h2>
          <p class="text-xs md:text-sm text-ink-soft leading-relaxed mt-2">
            <span data-lang="en">Scallops, a clifftop castle and the story of 1942.</span>
            <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Coquilles Saint-Jacques, un château sur la falaise et l'histoire de 1942.</span>
            <span data-lang="es" hidden>Vieiras, un castillo en el acantilado y la historia de 1942.</span>
          </p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="px-4 md:px-6 pt-4 pb-8 md:pb-16 md:max-w-md md:mx-auto">
      <p class="text-[10px] tracking-[0.15em] text-label uppercase font-bold text-center mb-4">
        <span data-lang="en">Contact Antoine</span>
        <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Contacter Antoine</span>
        <span data-lang="es" hidden>Contactar a Antoine</span>
      </p>
      <a
        href="https://wa.me/33626391783"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
        class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 w-full py-4 bg-whatsapp text-white rounded-2xl font-bold text-base no-underline mb-3"
      >
        <span>
          <span data-lang="en">Message on WhatsApp</span>
          <span data-lang="fr" hidden>Message sur WhatsApp</span>
          <span data-lang="es" hidden>Mensaje por WhatsApp</span>
        </span>
        <span class="block text-xs font-normal opacity-90">+33 6 26 39 17 83</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
